---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/as_of.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM t LEFT ASOF JOIN u MATCH_CONDITION (t.a >= u.a) ON t.b = u.d AND u.d = 'x'"
---
AsOfJoin LeftOuter, a#0 >= a#3, (b#1 == d#4)
:- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
+- Filter (d#4 == 'x')
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
